### 1\. Original PDF code

```python
from mitmproxy import http

def request(flow: http.HTTPFlow):
    print("====================================")
    print("Request URL :", flow.request.pretty_url)
    print("Request Method :", flow.request.method)
    print("Client IP :", flow.client_conn.address)
    print("====================================")

